{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:04:32.796Z","ordinal":68007,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac61905f6a887d0ae4495453d5db99b","status":"completed","call_id":"call_EIoMBXGAZXvG87KNjv6BR6uo","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport pathlib,json,hashlib,datetime,subprocess,os\\nroot=pathlib.Path.cwd();q=json.loads(pathlib.Path('/private/tmp/dev78-handover-local-qualification.json').read_text());assert q['candidateCommit']==subprocess.check_output(['git','rev-parse','HEAD'],text=True).strip();assert not subprocess.check_output(['git','status','--porcelain=v1'],text=True).strip()\\np=root/'docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-operation-handover.json';d=json.loads(p.read_text())\\nd['status']='T007 preparation locally accepted; tested native operational handover in draft #163 for Cooper review'\\nd['observedAt']=datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat();d['candidateCommit']=q['candidateCommit'];d['candidateTree']=q['tree'];d['pullRequest']='https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/163'\\nfor c in q['checks']:c['log']=pathlib.Path(c['log']).name\\nd['localQualification']=q;d['primaryReview']={'reviewer':'Codex primary TaxKit implementation owner','result':'Accept T007 named preparation outcomes locally; Cooper draft review outstanding','criteria':[{'criterion':'Exact source/account/stage/resource plans omit Production DNS for Preview','evidence':['2026-10-07-native-domains.json','2026-10-07-native-source-plan.json','2026-10-07-native-cloud-preparation.json','2026-10-07-agent-setup-and-cancellation-bounds.json','Current native graph and source/projection fixture checks; 273 cases pass']},{'criterion':'Doppler precedence, separate credential purposes and checked runtime bindings','evidence':['Existing secret boundary/code and checked admission fixtures are unchanged','Prior exact-source local nine-check and actual cloud binding reads','Existing Production/Preview credentials remain independently readable with matching identity/expiry; existing state stays version seven']},{'criterion':'Concrete authority precedes apply; domain/DNS/TLS/registrar readback stays separate','evidence':['Cooper local Preview/Production authority and exact Production token grant approval retained in the cloud receipt','Current handover includes paged names and settings, DNS and certificate next-page checks, DNSSEC/TLS/registrar observations','Future namespace pre-read required; no retroactive pr-162 pre-read claim']},{'criterion':'Required focused and full checks and affected owners are complete','evidence':['Eight focused handover checks pass, including 273 deployment cases','Full verification passes source 226c60bddb225467db64e772d48304af2368a216 in 684.12 seconds: 34 workflow, 26 SDK browser, 21 Website browser and 14 native pair cases','All 1750 frozen file/link identities match; earlier failed runbook/format attempts retained','Current runbooks, recovery, authority, infra/tool/architecture pointers, exact sidecar paths and task/plan are aligned']}],'contractLimits':['Named preparation task is accepted; no executed rollback, destroy or no-op convergence requirement was silently claimed','No new provider, credential or app deployment in this handover','Metrics remain deferred; unrelated RUM and Medicare choices stay explicit']}\\nd['impact']['changeRequired'].append('docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md later authority pointer')\\nd['documentationOnlyCloseout']={'paths':['docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md','docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json','docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md',str(p.relative_to(root))],'allOther1746FrozenIdentitiesUnchanged':'pending final comparison','focusedChecks':'pending before commit'}\\np.write_text(json.dumps(d,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\np=root/'docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json';t=json.loads(p.read_text());next(x for x in t['tasks'] if x['id']=='CSF-T007')['status']='completed';p.write_text(json.dumps(t,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\np=root/'docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md';s=p.read_text();old='This authority includes reviewable commits and draft PRs, but no merge, deploy,\\\\npublication or provider apply. Final provider-plan approval remains separate.';new='The original implementation authority includes reviewable commits and draft\\\\nPRs. Cooper subsequently authorised native TaxKit Preview and Production\\\\ndeployments from this Mac on 7 October after exact source, plans, credentials,\\\\nrecovery and readback are qualified, and separately approved the existing\\\\nProduction token permission change. The active plan and dated delivery receipts\\\\nrecord those operations. Merge, publication, credential creation and unrelated\\\\nprovider changes remain outside that authority; new provider operations need\\\\ntheir concrete approval boundary.';assert old in s;p.write_text(s.replace(old,new,1))\\np=root/'docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md';s=p.read_text();s=s.replace(\\\"Next continuation milestone: finish T007's current operational-owner alignment,\\\\nthen T008's accepted analytics work.\\\",\\\"Next continuation milestone: implement T008's accepted analytics work. T007's\\\\noperational handover is locally accepted and ready for draft review.\\\",1)\\nold=next(x for x in s.splitlines() if x.startswith('| T007 / DEV-78 |'));s=s.replace(old,'| T007 / DEV-78 | Complete locally; draft review outstanding | Exact native graph/source/secret/state/live plans are delivered in drafts #159–161, with #162 guide delivery. Draft #163 aligns the current native CLI/runbooks/recovery and paged provider reads. Full local verification passes `226c60bddb225467db64e772d48304af2368a216` in 684.12 seconds; all 1,750 frozen identities match, including the fourteen-case built app check. No new provider, state, credential or deployment mutation; rollback and no-op convergence remain unqualified. |',1)\\nold='**N/A** for a Changeset, public acceptance/generated content or provider\\\\nmutation: this is documentation-only. Focused and full local verification\\\\nremain pending after eight focused checks pass, including all 273 deployment\\\\ncases. The first runbook check required the exact evidence paths to be rendered;\\\\nthat owner correction passes without changing the check. Full verification at\\\\n`86dcf222c666c6f24fe509a070f88cd404cc1ff9` stopped at the existing JSON\\\\nformat check; the same formatter corrects the sidecar and its focused checks\\\\npass. The complete run is being repeated on the corrected clean commit. T007 stays In Progress\\\\nuntil primary review accepts its named preparation outcomes. Cloud rollback,\\\\nteardown, no-op convergence and overall\\\\nT010 delivery are not claimed.'\\nnew='**N/A** for a Changeset, public acceptance/generated content or provider\\\\nmutation: this is documentation-only. Eight focused checks pass, including all\\\\n273 deployment cases. The first runbook check required exact evidence paths to\\\\nbe rendered; that correction passes without changing the check. Full verification\\\\nat `86dcf222c666c6f24fe509a070f88cd404cc1ff9` stopped at the existing JSON\\\\nformat check; the same formatter corrects the sidecar and its focused checks pass.\\\\n\\\\nCorrected clean source `226c60bddb225467db64e772d48304af2368a216` passes full\\\\nverification in 684.12 seconds. All 1,750 frozen file/link identities match. The\\\\nrun includes 34 workflow cases, 26 SDK browser cases, 21 Website browser cases\\\\nand all 14 freshly built native Website/API cases. Primary review accepts T007\\\\nagainst its named preparation outcomes and affected owners; draft\\\\n[#163](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/163) awaits Cooper review. The\\\\nSPEC now points to the later dated deployment authority, rather than implying\\\\nthe original implementation-only boundary remains the latest instruction.\\\\nFour documentation/task/evidence closeout files use focused docs, runbook, path,\\\\nformat and diff checks; application and configuration source stay unchanged.\\\\nCloud rollback, teardown, no-op convergence and overall T010 delivery are not\\\\nclaimed. Continue T008; metrics and the Medicare decision remain separate.'\\nassert old in s;p.write_text(s.replace(old,new,1));print(json.dumps({'taskLocallyAccepted':'T007','draft':163,'metadataPaths':4,'newProviderWrite':False}))\\nPY\\npython3 /private/tmp/dev75-request-run-checks.py '[[\\\"docs\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"check:docs\\\"]],[\\\"runbooks\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"check:runbooks\\\"]],[\\\"paths\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"check:repository-paths\\\"]],[\\\"format\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"format:check\\\"]],[\\\"diff\\\",[\\\"git\\\",\\\"diff\\\",\\\"--check\\\"]]]' dev78-handover-closeout-a\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:1800}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","create_time":1791367408.098005}}}
